flowchart TB
  %% Scheduled reconciler — orchestration flow of ReconcilerService.run().
  %% Source of truth: src/reconciler/ (reconciler-guide skill).
  %% APScheduler (app lifespan) fires run() twice daily, then runs five billing
  %% step-services in order: invoice-fetch -> stale-task recovery ->
  %% orphan-cleanup -> payment-push -> subscription-orphans (cancel live Stripe
  %% subs with no live DB link, last), then a 6th NON-billing step:
  %% class-history materialize — a THIN per-gym loop calling the class system's
  %% own ClassesMaterializer.materialize_current(gym_id) (the same range
  %% materialize entry point the check-in resolve seam + the schedule board
  %% call) — touches no Stripe / membership / payment state, so it is fully
  %% independent and last.
  %% Stale-task recovery re-runs unfinished
  %% tracked tasks (src/tasks/) whose in-process run died — the recovery loop
  %% lives here, the tasks engine only knows how to run ONE task.
  %% No reconciler-wide lock — safety is the per-family PayingMemberLock every
  %% payment op already holds.
  %% Each step reuses existing machinery: the fetcher drives the webhook handler
  %% record() seam, the orphan cleanup checks the per-family lock, the push sweep
  %% calls bulk sync — whose sync now self-heals a gone subscription natively
  %% (cancels the family + nulls the sub id), so there is no separate status pass.
  %% Green = reconciler step/service · yellow = the orchestrator (fan-out hub) ·
  %% orange = external actors. Solid = live runtime call.

  sched["⏰ APScheduler — app lifespan, cron twice daily (UTC)<br/>fires ReconcilerService.run() · gated by settings.reconciler_enabled"]

  subgraph recon["🧹 ReconcilerService.run — sweep orchestrator"]
    direction TB
    fetch["InvoiceFetchSweep — missed-webhook backstop<br/>per gym Connect acct: list invoices / payments / refunds in the configured lookback<br/>→ reuse webhook handler record(obj) (the handle/record seam)<br/>paid → bill + succeeded charges · open+attempted → failed attempt · refunds<br/>idempotent: invoice upsert · charge/refund UNIQUE · failed synthetic key<br/>each object in its own txn · pending/not-recorded caught per object"]
    stale_task["StaleTaskSweep — re-run crashed tracked tasks<br/>list unfinished tasks → TasksExecutor.run_task each<br/>atomic claims skip live runs (pending or stale-running reclaimed)<br/>advances task state + converges via the engine; failed tasks left to push"]
    orphan["OrphanCleanupSweep — delete stranded not_added rows<br/>per orphan: non-blocking try paying-family lock<br/>free → delete (stripe_item_id IS NULL guard) · held → skip (op in flight)"]
    push["PaymentPushSweep — CRM→Stripe converge<br/>distinct paying parents w/ active recurring → bulk_payment_sync<br/>proration none = billing none (no charge)<br/>the sync self-heals a gone sub: cancel the family + null the sub id"]
    suborphan["SubscriptionOrphanSweep — cancel Stripe subs with no live DB link<br/>per Connect acct (deduped): list non-cancelled subs (mirrors invoice-fetch _iter)<br/>skip if younger than reconciler_orphan_min_age_seconds · skip if items &gt; one page<br/>sub item ids vs live rows (applied, unfiltered base) — none → cancel sub<br/>immediate cancel via payments primitive (idempotent) · each cancel isolated"]
    class_history["ClassHistorySweep — materialize class occurrences (NON-billing)<br/>6th step · independent of every billing step (no Stripe / membership / payment)<br/>THIN per-gym loop: list every gym → materialize_current(gym_id) each<br/>per-gym error isolation: one gym's failure counts an error, never aborts the rest<br/>the load/expand/write logic itself lives in ClassesMaterializer (class system)"]
    fetch --> stale_task
    stale_task --> orphan
    orphan --> push
    push --> suborphan
    suborphan --> class_history
  end

  handlers["📨 webhook handlers (stripe_webhooks) — record(obj) seam<br/>invoice_paid · invoice_payment_paid · invoice_payment_failed · refund"]
  engine["⚙️ PaymentSyncService.bulk_payment_sync<br/>loop families · fresh key + per-family lock · update_payments_recurring<br/>a gone sub → cancel the family + null the sub id (Stripe→CRM), never recreate"]
  class_engine["⚙️ ClassesMaterializer (src/classes) — THE range materialize entry point<br/>materialize(gym,start,end) / materialize_current: load + expand (via ClassesExpander)<br/>+ find-or-create class_history per occurrence, up to a shared forward cutoff<br/>idempotent via uq_class_history_occurrence; also called by check-in + the schedule board"]

  supabase["🗄️ Supabase (service-role) — reconciler_orphan_memberships<br/>reconciler_active_billing_members · gyms_with_connect · resource_locks<br/>cancel_date / 'deleted' writes · null stripe_sub_id_month · delete orphan"]
  stripe["💳 Stripe — gym Connect: list invoices / payments / refunds · retrieve / update / cancel subscription"]

  sched -->|"twice daily"| recon
  recon -->|"invoice-fetch: reuse handler record on listed objects"| handlers
  recon -->|"push: bulk_payment_sync (billing none)"| engine
  recon -->|"orphan-cleanup: list + delete orphans (per-family lock check)"| supabase
  recon -->|"stale-task recovery: read unfinished + advance task state"| supabase
  recon -->|"invoice-fetch: list recent activity per gym"| stripe
  recon -->|"subscription-orphans: list subs · cancel unlinked (per Connect acct)"| stripe
  recon -->|"subscription-orphans: live item-id linkage check"| supabase
  recon -->|"class-history (non-billing): materialize_current(gym_id) per gym"| class_engine
  handlers -->|"upsert invoice / charge / refund rows"| supabase
  engine -->|"read desired state · write back · cancel a gone sub"| supabase
  engine -->|"create / update / cancel subscription"| stripe
  class_engine -->|"read gym's classes + exceptions + timezone · upsert class_history rows"| supabase

  classDef svc fill:#e6f7ec,stroke:#2f8f53,color:#0c3a1f;
  classDef ext fill:#ffd9a8,stroke:#d2691e,color:#4a2c08;
  classDef hub fill:#fdf0c8,stroke:#caab2f,color:#4a3d08;
  class sched,handlers,engine,class_engine svc;
  class supabase,stripe ext;
  class fetch,stale_task,orphan,push,suborphan,class_history svc;
  style recon fill:#fdf0c8,stroke:#caab2f;
